# Prohibido código en duro

Before creating or editing mappings/catalogs in this project, follow `.cursor/skills/no-hardcoded-business-data/SKILL.md`.

- **Never** hardcode account codes, FNS concept→account maps, or similar business tables in Python/JS.
- Store mappings in DB catalogs / `app/data` JSON; resolve at runtime from active rows.
- If you find hardcoded business maps while editing, move them to the catalog and delete the literals.
